{"version": 2, "width": 140, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1792452924, "idle_time_limit": 5.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/usr/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "duration": 16.93636}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCleiMesh · signed permissions for AI agents, enforced by the sandbox, with proof\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;7m ACT 3 — PROOF: signed receipts anyone can check \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.506107, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m13. Every call, allowed or blocked, left a signed, chained receipt with no content\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh audit tail -n 6\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.562464, "o", "  2026-10-19 23:36:19 [38ae91] allowed  file_write     caller=12D3KooWHUx9QC… aat depth=0 holder=CUp3hk71OLSPXP…\r\n  2026-10-19 23:36:19 [6c7515] result   file_write     succeeded (decision 38ae91)\r\n  2026-10-19 23:36:25 [e980bf] allowed  file_read      caller=12D3KooWHUx9QC… aat depth=0 holder=CUp3hk71OLSPXP…\r\n  2026-10-19 23:36:25 [2cb704] result   file_read      succeeded (decision e980bf)\r\n  2026-10-19 23:36:30 [772deb] DENIED   file_write     caller=12D3KooWHUx9QC… file_write refused: holder CUp3hk71OLSPXP… in this chain re…\r\n  2026-10-19 23:36:36 [31629a] DENIED   file_write     caller=12D3KooWS8fXED… file_write refused: holder CUp3hk71OLSPXP… in this chain re…\r\n"]
[3.567536, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh audit verify\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.027232, "o", "  OK: 13 receipts in ./receipts.jsonl, signed by 12D3KooWJsgE7BYFyxCCUuTJpzqsu3PVCfwh67pweeiz56GnkvWV\r\n    head ./receipts.jsonl.head matches\r\n"]
[7.564028, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m14. Don't trust the receipt: replay it. The auditor runs step 7's calculation again and compares\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.618218, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh audit replay <receipt> --args input.json\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.554594, "o", "  REPRODUCED 01a15685-b87e-70dc-8af1-817dd4919131: same outcome and output (sha256\r\n            84a7bad33067e74c2aaec66fb17369560de926455f58a5ea9419c42ea861a130)\r\n"]
[9.58422, "o", "  same module, same input, same frozen clock and seed: the output matches the receipt\r\n"]
[13.089229, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m15. Privacy law: what was done with customer-42's data (the receipt keeps only a pseudonym)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.089928, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh audit report --subject customer-42\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.243976, "o", "  # Processing report for a data subject\r\n  - **Data subject (pseudonym):** `hmac-sha256:93efd4e96b31c8110b7da58a7815bee7a0f142ab5c3a11806431f88c1e3ce652`\r\n  - **Period:** the whole log\r\n  - **Node that signed the receipts:** `12D3KooWJsgE7BYFyxCCUuTJpzqsu3PVCfwh67pweeiz56GnkvWV`\r\n"]
[13.24408, "o", "  - **Log verification:** intact: signatures and chaining checked (13 receipts)\r\n  ## Summary\r\n"]
[13.244139, "o", "  - Operations: 1 (1 allowed, 0 denied; 0 of the allowed failed to run)\r\n  - Distinct agents: 1\r\n  - Declared purposes: customer support\r\n"]
[13.252085, "o", "  and a table with each operation: when, which agent, through which delegation, tool, purpose, decision, access granted and receipt\r\n"]
[16.753974, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m16. What if someone edits the log to hide an attempt?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.787691, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh audit verify   (after swapping a failure for a success)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.936302, "o", "  line 4: signature does not verify\r\n"]
[16.93636, "o", "  line 5: prev_hash does not match the previous line (line changed, removed or reordered)\r\n"]
